@startuml
title Secure Access to Event Organiser Account

actor "Event Organiser" as Organiser
boundary "Login Page" as LoginUI
control "Flask Auth Route" as AuthRoute
control "Supabase Client" as SupabaseClient
database "Supabase Auth" as SupabaseAuth
boundary "Organiser Interface" as OrganiserUI
control "Event Route / Service" as EventService
database "Supabase Database\nwith RLS" as Database

== Login ==

Organiser -> LoginUI: Enter email and password
LoginUI -> AuthRoute: Submit login credentials
AuthRoute -> SupabaseClient: create_supabase_client()
SupabaseClient -> SupabaseAuth: sign_in_with_password()

alt Valid credentials
    SupabaseAuth --> SupabaseClient: Authenticated user + session
    SupabaseClient -> Database: Verify profile and event_organiser role
    alt Profile and Event Organiser role exist
        Database --> SupabaseClient: Access confirmed
        SupabaseClient --> AuthRoute: Authentication and role verification successful
        AuthRoute --> LoginUI: Login successful
        LoginUI --> OrganiserUI: Show Event Organiser functionality
    else Profile or Event Organiser role missing
        Database --> SupabaseClient: Required access record not found
        SupabaseClient -> SupabaseAuth: sign_out()
        SupabaseClient --> AuthRoute: Event Organiser access denied
        AuthRoute --> LoginUI: Access denied
    end
else Invalid credentials
    SupabaseAuth --> SupabaseClient: Authentication error
    SupabaseClient --> AuthRoute: Authentication failure
    AuthRoute --> LoginUI: Access denied
end

== Authorised Event Access ==

Organiser -> OrganiserUI: Open own event
OrganiserUI -> EventService: Request event information
EventService -> SupabaseClient: Query event
SupabaseClient -> Database: SELECT event using authenticated session

alt Event belongs to organiser and RLS allows access
    Database --> SupabaseClient: Event data
    SupabaseClient --> EventService: Authorised event
    EventService --> OrganiserUI: Display event information
else Event is not authorised
    Database --> SupabaseClient: No accessible row
    SupabaseClient --> EventService: No authorised event returned
    EventService --> OrganiserUI: Event information not disclosed
end

== Authorised Event Modification ==

Organiser -> OrganiserUI: Update own editable event
OrganiserUI -> EventService: Submit event change
EventService -> SupabaseClient: Request current event
SupabaseClient -> Database: SELECT event using authenticated session

alt Event is authorised and status is draft, requested, or changes_requested
    Database --> SupabaseClient: Authorised editable event
    EventService -> SupabaseClient: Update permitted event name
    SupabaseClient -> Database: UPDATE event using authenticated session
    Database --> SupabaseClient: Updated event
    SupabaseClient --> EventService: Update successful
    EventService --> OrganiserUI: Display updated event
else Event is not authorised
    Database --> SupabaseClient: No authorised update
    SupabaseClient --> EventService: Update rejected
    EventService --> OrganiserUI: Event remains unchanged
else Event is not draft
    Database --> SupabaseClient: Authorised non-editable event
    SupabaseClient --> EventService: Update rejected for event status
    EventService --> OrganiserUI: Display event as read-only
end

== Logout ==

Organiser -> OrganiserUI: Select Logout
OrganiserUI -> AuthRoute: Logout request
AuthRoute -> SupabaseClient: Sign out authenticated session
SupabaseClient -> SupabaseAuth: sign_out()
SupabaseAuth --> SupabaseClient: Session ended
SupabaseClient --> AuthRoute: Logout successful
AuthRoute --> OrganiserUI: Protected functionality inaccessible
OrganiserUI --> Organiser: Return to unauthenticated state

@enduml
